  "description": "Free in-process developer tools for Avalonia 12: a live tree of every window in the application, property editing, layout and style inspection, a timeline of events and changes with the call stack behind each one, a problems pane, search, screenshots and more. Optionally serves an MCP endpoint on loopback, so a coding agent can inspect the running application too — read-only by default, with clicking and typing behind a separate opt-in. Works under any application theme. Attach with this.AttachAvaDevTools() and press F12.",
